get.description:
Recent audit_log entries, newest first. Offset-paginated;
fine for the homelab scale (a few thousand rows). If we hit the
wall, switch to keyset on audit_log.id.

All agreements for an engagement, newest first. The history
chain (supersedes_id) is reachable via repeated detail fetches;
this list view just orders by created_at.

PersonCreate.description:
Create a fresh address-book person. The supporting per-kind row
is auto-inserted: kind='student' → empty student_details;
kind='guardian' / 'other' → people row only.
